// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Guided_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3616975982" "I'd like you to make a little trip up north, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>There's a friend of mine named Gordon Bower who could really use your help.</A> Gordon's the mayor of a little resort village named Salamanca.  Lately the atmosphere up there has been... well, weird.  Disturbing.  Deadly, even.  There's far too much for me to explain, and you might not believe me if I did.  You'll just have to see it for yourself."
// AcceptString :
"P521763816" "Go see Gordon Bower"
// SendOffString :
"P1826909314" "The village's name is Salamanca, but people have been calling the area Croatoa lately.  You'll see why once you get there."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P76032087" "I told Gordon to expect you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P877390142" "Thank you for coming.  As you can see, Salamanca isn't a nice place to live.  Not anymore.  We've got a few amateur mystics trying to keep our town safe, but we need more than their spells, {HeroName}.  We need you. <br><br>I know Salamanca's problems aren't the only ones you face.  Come at any time, and I will be grateful for your help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SC_Longbow_Liason_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1643382884" "I don't know if you realize this, {HeroName}, but as we speak, Paragon City is under assault.  Over in Siren's Call, Lord Recluse and his men are making every effort to get themselves a foothold.  If we let them manage it, we'll be in serious trouble.  I'd appreciate it if you'd go speak with the Longbow Warzone Liaison over in Steel Canyon.  She could use the help of Heroes like you. <br><br> <color red>Siren's Call is a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3234632821" "Talk to Warzone Liaison"
// SendOffString :
"P278926820" "The Warzone Liaison can help you get the right contacts in Siren's Call."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3883228237" "The Warzone Liaison wants to speak to you about Siren's Call."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2204349039" "If you're ready to take on a real challenge, you can be a big help to Longbow here in Siren's Call.  We have to push Arachnos out.  If you're willing, you can talk to <color orange>Agent Brinson</color>.  He's got a number of missions that will swing the battle in Longbow's favor.  Or you can talk to the <color orange>Security Chief</color> at the Longbow base; he can tell you all about bounties. <br><br>Siren's Call is a PVP zone.  If you enter, you may be killed by other players.  Do not enter if you are not willing to risk this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3927187947" "I hope the Warzone Liaison gave you the info you need to help out in Siren's Call.  It would be a shame to lose that zone to Arachnos."
